<title>BELGIUM: Belgian UCB sets unchanged interim div.</title>
<headline>Belgian UCB sets unchanged interim div.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net dividend (ordinary share) *   100 vs   100</p>
<p>    Net dividend (AFV share)	*   115 vs   115</p>
<p>    Pay date				  Dec 16, 1996</p>
<p>NOTE - * interim. Final dividend to be fixed at June 1997 annual general meeting.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
